    "text": "Dryhten \u00feu halga god, \u00feu eart \u00e6lmihtig & ece god.\nIc forworht & synful bidde \u00fe\u00e6t \u00f0u onsende in me heortan meagolmod gemynd & gedefe hreowe & so\u00f0e\n\u00deu eart eallra cyninga cyning & toweard dema cwicra & deadra for\u00f0on ic gearwe wat \u00fe\u00e6t \u00f0e siendan\nIc ondette \u00fee bote & eallum \u00feinum englum \u00fea \u00f0u eadige & cl\u00e6ne geheolde \u00fe\u00e6t hie mostan \u00feinre onsiene\nIc ondette eallum halgum sawlum & eac menniscum men minum scrifte gastlicum l\u00e6ce for mine sawle\nIc ondette ealra synna cynn \u00fee me \u00e6fre \u00feurh o wiht awiergde g\u00e6stas on besmitan o\u00f0\u00f0e ic self \u00feurh\nIc eom ondetta sodomiscre synne \u00fee hie on gegyltan, \u00fe\u00e6t is geligre, leasunga, gitsunga,\nIc ondette gifernesse metes & drinces \u00e6rtidum & in tide geeac ofer riht tide.\nIc ondette \u00e6lcre gitsunge cynne \u00fee ic \u00e6fre beeode.\nIc ondette \u00e6fste & t\u00e6lnesse, twyspr\u00e6cnesse & leasunge, ellenhete & ni\u00f0, unnyttes gylpes bigong & idle\nIc ondette \u00fe\u00e6t ic w\u00e6s synna wyrhta & synna gewita, syna latteow & lareow & ge\u00feafa.\nIc ondette modes mor\u00feor & m\u00e6ne a\u00f0as, unsibbe & eofulsunge ofermetto & unmodennesse & receleaste\nIc eom ondetta ealra gesewenlicra lusta & ungesewenra \u00feara \u00fee ic \u00e6fre gefremede on ciricean o\u00f0\u00f0e\nIc eom ondetta \u00fe\u00e6t ic onfeng on minne mu\u00f0 wealworda & yfelre r\u00e6dnesse unnyttra blissa \u00feara \u00fee ic on\nIc ondette hatheortnesse & sleacornesse, slapornesse & unnytte w\u00e6ccean, feondscipe & feowunge\nIc ondette eall \u00fe\u00e6t ic \u00e6fre to unnytte mid minum eagum gesawe o\u00f0\u00f0e mid minum earum gehyrde o\u00f0\u00f0e\nIc ondette mine synna forealne minne lichoman forfell & fl\u00e6sc, fet & sconcan, breost & ban & ba\nIc ondette gode \u00e6lmihtigum & \u00f0emenniscummen minum gastlicum scrifte \u00fe\u00e6t ic min fulwiht & mine\nIc ondet